contentMarkdown:
This foldable wallet offers you 4 slots for cards in the front pockets (the inner ones in blue on the pictures), 2 other pockets for bills or tickets or even other cards below the blue pockets, and also a big space to place bills and money into the main big pocket, like a classical french wallet.

It is made of 2 oiled leather with 2 different colours but can be made in monochrome too. You can see the [list of leathers](notion:b82a8bf9ee1040e0816e7a0581027cbd) or use the [colour picker](https://lord.crofte.fr/leather-color-picker) to help you with available combination.

[🎨 Play with the colours](https://lord.crofte.fr/leather-color-picker/?c2=brown&c1=blue&p=1)

